<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Filmy</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; }
        .container { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { color: #333333; }
        .content { font-size: 16px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.5; }
        .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #999999; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="header">Welcome to Filmy! 🎬</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi <strong><%= email %></strong>,</p>
            <p>Thank you for signing up. We are thrilled to have you on board!</p>
            <p>Get ready to explore the best movies and series.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Filmy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
